OL,3,GNEWSADrivers report 'huge fire' after
OL,4,AM42 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers caught in standstill traffic on
OL,7,Fthe M42 described seeing a "huge fire"
OL,8,Fafter a serious crash forced the
OL,9,Fclosure of part of the motorway near
OL,10,FBirmingham.
OL,12,FNational Highways said the northbound
OL,13,Fcarriageway was shut between junction
OL,14,F5A, near Birmingham Airport, and
OL,15,Fjunction six, with police and an air
OL,16,Fambulance among the emergency services
OL,17,Fat the scene.
OL,19,FTransport for West Midlands said there
OL,20,Fwere heavy delays against expected
OL,21,Ftraffic levels, with congestion
OL,22,Fbuilding on approaches to the closure.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
